{"title":"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/6/e36ca4d895e9c7d3bcc5d89ec63576fa05327625.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{31}{72} = \\frac{a}{8} + \\frac{b}{9} - c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"127\" height=\"39\" />.<br />\nWhat is the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Modular_Arithmetic.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Modular_Arithmetic)\">Solution 1 (Modular Arithmetic)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Modular Arithmetic)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/5/9c5aff94800e33de6b85301713d8227ee09f1139.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72 \\times \\frac{31}{72} = 72(\\frac{a}{8} + \\frac{b}{9} - c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/8/f38153535307f371d0f578432e6cdcee51435b29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$31 = 9a + 8b - 72c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"150\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Taking this mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/b/17b16c5d4c092fdfa6929973a181afb153ffb613.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9a + 8b - 72c \\equiv 31 \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"223\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e7334e9e2c7a7cc95dc0ef09586217ea3e998b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-b \\equiv -5 \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/e/b3e1a844bc8190ce76be06a503fe2a53ae96177d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\equiv 5 \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. We want to minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> while having <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be a positive integer, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/a/7aad2265d242a172f2b9f47cbfc94babd9df7555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{b = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"54\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>We can also show that this works as a value by plugging it in:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/8/74889259f1f69b49b3e8c0b40ff8a78743ee095b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9a + 8 \\times 5 - 72c = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"174\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/3/4830379e9951ebe244f7f2c5dd733748d22a280b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9a + 40 - 72c = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"152\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6bfa873ac35388946da834046b35b69ed1ca2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9a - 72c = 31 - 40 = -9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"199\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We then see that this works if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/1/9b1838491bea2799f90f459e5a942e9dd6d7c4c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/5/5351998230e216d9d0f2884c159326cfe6622263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC\" title=\"2017 CIMC\">2017 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018030528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 139/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1289/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 140/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4160/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.057      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%   16.057      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37153:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018030528 and revision id 287007. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}